## Calendar / Actions Workspace Review

Calendar and Actions are now meaningful product surfaces rather than future ideas.

Current direction is good:

- Dates are reviewed before export.
- Actions can be filtered and managed across meetings.
- Action state is local and editable.

Design guidance:

