4. Tighten typography and spacing using the UI Design System.
5. Keep reducing visible infrastructure complexity.
6. Screenshot-test updated Calendar, Actions, Search, and Meeting Workspace at real Windows scaling.
7. Prepare realtime transcript UX patterns before implementation.

Secondary / later priorities:

- Light theme depth refinement.
- Colorful theme reassessment or toning down.
- Optional compact mode only if real screen usage shows density problems.
- Export/print polish for executive meeting summaries.

