## Communication Notes For Codex / Engineering

When implementing UI changes, prioritize:

- Readability first.
- Consistent spacing.
- Predictable interaction behavior.
- Minimal visual clutter.
- Calm enterprise presentation.
- Screenshot-tested layouts.
- Reduced cognitive load.
- Workflow-oriented hierarchy.

When implementing workflow changes, prioritize:

- Clarity of meeting state.
- Confidence in recording/transcription state.
- Fast review workflows.
- Easy action-item visibility.
- Long-term meeting usability.

When implementing future features, avoid:

- Feature overload.
- Excessive dashboard density.
- Developer-centric UX.
- Infrastructure-heavy language.
- Excessive visual effects.
